{"8": {"item": {"category_name": "Registration", "id": 8, "category_id": 39, "link": "", "clickcount": 0, "createtime": 1593482099, "title": "Registration of a new user", "content": "<p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: \"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: Arial;\">Registering a Kakobuy account is very simple</span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: \"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\">1. Click the</span><a href=\"https://www.sugargoo.com/index/user/register.html?url=&partnercode=U0dfd2Vic2l0ZQ==\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); outline: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\">&nbsp;</span></a><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"https://www.kakobuy.com/index/user/register.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); outline: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">\u201cFree Registration\u201d</span></a></span><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\">&nbsp;button on the top of the Kakobuy&nbsp;home page.</span></span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: \"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\">2. Visit the registration page, fill out your commonly used e-mail address, set up the username and password, enter the verification code, then click the &quot;Register&quot; button to complete the registration.<br/></span></span></p>"}}, "45": {"item": {"category_name": "Types of services", "id": 45, "category_id": 34, "link": "", "clickcount": 0, "createtime": 1652926404, "title": "\u8d2d\u4e70YUPOO\u3001\u5fae\u5e97\u65b9\u5f0f", "content": "<p>111</p>"}}, "80": {"item": {"category_name": "Shopping Agent Service", "id": 80, "category_id": 35, "link": "", "clickcount": 0, "createtime": 1657608226, "title": "Description of purchase order", "content": "<p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-size: 13px;\">[Pending payment]: A purchase order has been generated, but no payment has been made. You can directly pay for the goods in this state.</span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-size: 13px;\"><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"></span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-size: 13px;\">[Paid]: The purchase order has been paid successfully</span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-size: 13px;\"><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"></span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-size: 13px;\">[Purchased]: The purchaser is purchasing from the merchant or the purchase has been successful, waiting for the merchant to deliver</span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-size: 13px;\"><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"></span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-size: 13px;\">[Shipped]: The merchant has shipped the goods, waiting for the goods to arrive at the Kakobuy warehouse</span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-size: 13px;\"><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"></span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-size: 13px;\">[Has been stored]: The goods have arrived at Kakobuy&nbsp;warehouse to sign for receipt, and will be put on the shelf after inspection and weighing are completed</span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-size: 13px;\"><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"></span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-size: 13px;\">[Avaliable for shipment</span>]: Commodities can be submitted for international shipping</p>"}}, "84": {"item": {"category_name": "Shopping Agent Service", "id": 84, "category_id": 35, "link": "", "clickcount": 0, "createtime": 1657608640, "title": "What should I do after merchandises are arrived?", "content": "<p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\"ARRIVED\" means that the product you purchased has entered the Kakobuy warehouse. The warehouse will then inspect your package and measure the weight and volume of the product. After the above process is completed, the product will be put on the shelf and the product status will become \"Can submit the waybill\", at this time you can find the order that can submit the waybill in the member center-my order, then submit the waybill and pay for the freight.<br style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-size: 13px;\"><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"></span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-size: 13px;\">Since the weight and volume measured after the goods are put into storage may be different from the weight and volume after the final product is packaged, the final actual shipping fee and the shipping fee you paid may also be different. It is recommended that you keep a certain amount in your account balance to avoid the situation that the package cannot be delivered on time because the payment is not made in time</span></p>"}}, "100": {"item": {"category_name": "Payment Methods", "id": 100, "category_id": 43, "link": "", "clickcount": 0, "createtime": 1657618517, "title": "How to top up KAKOBUY account", "content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Log in to the account, enter the \u201cmember center\u201d, and click Recharge. You can directly enter or select the recharge amount, the unit is yuan.</span><br></p>"}}, "111": {"item": {"category_name": "Tracking", "id": 111, "category_id": 55, "link": "", "clickcount": 0, "createtime": 1657694176, "title": "How can I track the logistics details after parcel are sent?", "content": "<p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">After the parcel is dispatched, you can log in to the member center and click \"Logistics Details\" in \"My Parcel\" to view. (If you cannot view the logistics information through the system, we will provide you with other query URLs for query)</p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Tips: International logistics involves multiple party(s), there will be a certain lag in the update of logistics information.</p>"}}, "117": {"item": {"category_name": "About Parcel Value-Added Services", "id": 117, "category_id": 75, "link": "", "clickcount": 0, "createtime": 1657695417, "title": "Pre-packaged", "content": "<p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><b style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); outline: 0px !important; text-decoration-line: underline;\">Pre-packaged:\uffe518/once</span></span></b></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><b style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"></b></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><b style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: Arial;\">Definition:</span></b></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><b style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: Arial;\"></span></b><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: Arial;\">Pre-packing is a value-added service for obtaining parcel weight information before the parcel is officially sent</span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><b style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: Arial;\">Service Description:</span></b></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: Arial;\">Users can choose the following two ways to purchase pre-packaged services</span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: Arial;\">1. Have submited the parcel (no freight will be paid for the time being)</span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: Arial;\">Please note the parcel number (S+number) when purchasing the \"pre-packing\" service. We will directly update the weight of the parcel after the \"pre-packing\" is completed. You can send it directly after you pay the package fee. (If the packaging requirements of the \"pre-packaged\" remarks are inconsistent with the packaging requirements of the actual parcel, the parcel weight will not be updated, and the \"pre-packaged\" result will be sent in the form of a station letter)</span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: Arial;\">2. No parcel submitted</span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: Arial;\">When purchasing the \"pre-packaged\" service, please note the product number (OG+number) that requires \"pre-packaged\". It is recommended that all the products that require \"pre-packaged\" are in the state of \"can submit parcel\" before purchasing the \"pre-packaged\" service, if the product arrives Warehouse, we will deal with the goods after they are in the warehouse.</span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: Arial;\">Timeliness and presentation method: The pre-packing is completed within 24 hours after the user purchases the service and the parcel weight information is sent through this Order Message</span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><b style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: Arial;\">Please fill in the following in the \"Remarks\" box:</span></b></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: Arial;\">1. According to the above two \"pre-packaged\" purchase methods, please note the \"pre-packaged\" parcel number (S+number) or product number (OG+number), for example: S202009150007 or OG20200914011;</span></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: Arial;\">2. Packaging requirements, for example: remove shoe box packaging</span></p>"}}, "114": {"item": {"category_name": "About Order Value-Added Services", "id": 114, "category_id": 74, "link": "", "clickcount": 0, "createtime": 1657695192, "title": "Personalized photograph", "content": "<p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Personalized photograph</p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Definition: Personalized&nbsp;photo is a personalized photo service launched to meet the diverse photograph needs of users.</p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Service description: After the order is \"in stock\", if users need to take photos of products, such as partial logos, measuring clothing length, etc., you can purchase this service.</p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Timeliness and presentation: users will receive photos sent by internal message within 24 hours after purchasing the service</p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Charge standard: 2 yuan / piece (please take the corresponding purchase quantity according to the number of photos required)\uff0cthis service can be purchased from the \"Discount Information\" on the homepage.</p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Please fill in the following in the \"Remarks\" box:</p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">1). Product ID of the product to be photographed (OG+number)</p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">2). Explain the specific needs of taking pictures, such as taking a picture of a chest LOGO and measuring a photo of the clothing length.</p>"}}, "7": {"item": {"category_name": "International transit", "id": 7, "category_id": 69, "link": "", "clickcount": 0, "createtime": 1593481922, "title": "How to submit a transfer order.", "content": "<p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">1. Purchasing transfer orders</p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">If you submit a purchasing order, you can submit a transshipment order after the purchasing product is put on the shelf. The operation process is as follows:</p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">1. Log in to Kakobuy, click \"Member Center\", and enter \"My Order\"</p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">2. Select the product under the status of \"submit waybill\" (multiple goods shipped in a package, please check the required goods at the same time), click \"submit waybill\", click \"submit waybill\" to enter the waybill submission Page, then select your consignee address, the system will automatically provide all the available channels and shipping costs in the country, customers can choose the desired route according to your needs. After checking the fees, click \"Submit Waybill\" and complete the payment That's it.</p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">2. Consolidation</p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">The transfer submission operation process is as follows:</p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">1. Click \"International Address\" in the member center, fill in your overseas consignee information, and then click \"Add\" in the upper right corner to save your consignee information.</p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">2. Select Consolidation on the homepage, enter the consolidation page and submit product information and logistics information, and then wait for the transshipment package to be stored</p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">3. After the goods are in the warehouse, you can enter \"My Orders\" in the Member Center\" and select the goods in the state of \"Can submit the waybill\" (If multiple goods are shipped in packages, please check the required goods at the same time. Yes), click \"Submit Waybill\" to enter the page for submitting the waybill, and then select your consignee address. The system will automatically provide all the available channels and shipping costs in the country. Customers can choose what they need according to their needs Route. After checking the cost, click \"Submit Waybill\" and complete the payment.</p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none;\"></p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Tips:</p><p style=\"border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Only the goods/parcels that have arrived in the warehouse can be selected and submitted to the waybill. Customers who have not arrived in the warehouse please wait for a while, and Kakobuy\u00a0will notify you through the system when they arrive in the warehouse.</p>"}}, "55": {"item": {"category_name": "Types of services", "id": 55, "category_id": 34, "link": "", "clickcount": 0, "createtime": 1653657386, "title": "Guide to 1688 Shopping Agent Service", "conten