yle=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: content-box; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;microsoft yahei&quot;, STHeitiSC-Light, simsun, sans-serif; word-break: keep-all; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: content-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; word-break: keep-all; font-size: 9pt; font-family: \u5fae\u8f6f\u96c5\u9ed1, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">4) Remember to settle the rules of return and exchange with your seller and clarify things like who would pay for shipment.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: content-box; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;microsoft yahei&quot;, STHeitiSC-Light, simsun, sans-serif; word-break: keep-all; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: content-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; word-break: keep-all; font-size: 10pt; font-family: \u5fae\u8f6f\u96c5\u9ed1, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: content-box; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;microsoft yahei&quot;, STHeitiSC-Light, simsun, sans-serif; word-break: keep-all; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: content-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; word-break: keep-all; font-size: 10pt; font-family: \u5fae\u8f6f\u96c5\u9ed1, &quot;sans-serif&